<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tegal cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tegal cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Tegal Corp to long-term neutral from accumulate and kept its near-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 3/8 to 4-3/4.</p>
</text>
